  "aiContextParagraph": "President Prabowo Subianto has officially initiated the search for a new vice president following the vacancy left by Gibran. The president stated that the selection process will proceed after his return from official trips to Manila and Shenzhen. According to reports, President Prabowo has invited political parties to deliberate and submit their preferred candidates for the position. While several names have emerged in public discourse as potential contenders, including members of various political factions, the Gerindra Party has emphasized that any chosen candidate must possess the capability to effectively execute the administration's government programs. Officials have indicated that the president is looking for a leader who aligns with his vision, with the president humorously noting that the choice may require divine guidance. The legislative and political response remains in early stages as parties coordinate their official positions regarding the succession process.",
